            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Ca Nam Loi",
            "review_text": "dungmiakem\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam794 contributions\n0\nauthentic fish noodle soup but angry service\nJun 2024 • Solo\ni have been visiting here since 2000. it is an azing fish noodle soup restaurant. the broth is amazing, sweet and surely not coming from MSG. fish meat is thinly slice. they offer 2 type of noodle: egg noodle and rice based noodle. with two tyoe of meat: fish or chicken. the pate chaud is amazing too, try dipping in the broth. it is worth it. price is 100k/portion. beware of the service cause they are like coming from angry bird\nRead more\nWritten June 15, 2024",
