            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Ca Nam Loi",
            "review_text": "Simon P\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam111 contributions\n0\nFlavourful Fish noodle soup but comes with overprice and bad customer service!\nApr 2016 • Friends\nNam Loi noodle soup is a family-run business and has been a fond eatery during my childhood. Apart from the flavourful broth, they serves amazing pata chaud here, their signature puff pastry with flaky layers and meat filling. However, the charm has sadly long gone due to family conflicts and nowadays, people are experiencing unreasonable price and bad, ignorance customer service, sometimes yelling. Very small portion. I would not really recommended this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 12, 2016",
