            "review_title": "Review at Hu Tieu Ca Nam Loi",
            "review_text": "9za\nSanta Clara, California87 contributions\n0\nWhite or Yellow Noodles Soup\nSep 2015 • Friends\nself seated or sharing a table with other patron if you want to eat at this noodle shop. Rice or egg noodle can be ordered with a combo and or chicken - slice of fish filet. The broth is tasty and it's good with pate chaud [ baked puff pastry and grounded pork]. A little red vinegar, fresh grounded pepper, fresh chily then bon appetit.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 24, 2015",
